```
id: SPL-007
name: Large outbound transfer through the web proxy
description: A user uploads a large volume to destinations that are not on the sanctioned list.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Exfiltration
mitre_technique: T1567 Exfiltration Over Web Service
severity: Medium
data_source: index=proxy
false_positives: Backups to approved cloud, video conferencing, software publishing.
tuning: Keep sanctioned_destinations.csv current; use per-user baselines for heavy uploaders.
test_method: Upload a large file to a lab file-sharing site through the proxy.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=proxy earliest=-1h NOT [| inputlookup sanctioned_destinations.csv | rename domain AS dest | fields dest]
| stats sum(bytes_out) AS total_out dc(dest) AS destinations values(dest) AS dest_sample BY user, src
| eval mb_out=round(total_out/1024/1024,1)
| where mb_out>=500
| sort - mb_out
